  "reference": "https://gitlab.com/librespacefoundation/satnogs/satnogs-decoders/-/blob/master/ksy/kostka.ksy",
  "document": "SatNOGS decoders \"kostka.ksy\" (Kaitai Struct). Fields checked against 2026-10 beacons in JJ1WTK's satellite log (https://www.jj1wtk.jp/).",
  "note": "KOSTKA's beacons carry no message identifier except MRG (\"U,\"): OBC, SOL and EPS are told apart by their number of comma-separated fields (match_count 9 / 10 / 15). Units of the SOL temperatures (°C) and voltages (V) are inferred from the ksy names and the values; temperatures and currents of MRG/EPS are raw values whose unit is not documented. The CW beacon (de ok0kst = u..r..t..p.. ar) is defined from kostka.ksy but has not been checked against a received CW frame.",
